        "original_id": "43712b85-367d-5235-a585-f9ac28ee8579",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Southern Africa, Zambezi River, Zimbabwe, Zambia\n- People: Cecil Rhodes\n- Topics: British protectorates, colonial history, borders\n\nFacts:\n- Cecil Rhodes founded the former British protectorate in the southern Africa territory.\n- The former British protectorate later became two countries: Zimbabwe and Zambia.\n- The Zambezi River became the border between Zimbabwe and Zambia.\n- Zimbabwe lies south of the Zambezi River.\n- Zambia lies north of the Zambezi River.",
